/* REMOVED: `body h1#info-modal-h-sell-items { font-size: 0 }` + a ::before
   injecting content: "Steam Inventory". The real H1 reads "Sell Items" and is
   the target of the dialog's aria-labelledby, so screen readers announced
   "Sell Items" while sighted users saw "Steam Inventory". The injected text was
   also wrong for what the panel renders signed-out: a "Sign in required" gate,
   not an inventory. And because the id rule (1,1,1) also forced padding:0 it
   outranked every gutter rule, dropping the heading flush onto the panel's 1px
   rounded border. Deleting both rules lets `.full-page-mode h1.info-modal-header`
   (0,2,1) supply padding: 12px 24px again. */

