/* FIXER B2-1 — .info-modal-body sets text-align:center !important (~21607)
   for prose-style info modals, but the buy-order create form INHERITS it:
   catalogue-picker rows rendered the item name centered ~600px away from its
   thumbnail, and the picked-item summary + field labels floated centered.
   Re-anchor the whole create form left like every other list/form row —
