   Explicitly-centered children (.empty-inline etc.) keep their own rules. */
html body .info-modal .info-modal-body .buyorder-form { text-align: left !important; }

/* FIXER B2-2 — on the full-page /buy-orders route the create form inherited
   the 1800px wide-route panel width, blowing the single-value price/qty
